<title>USA: Default year-end shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Default year-end shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Default Proof Credit Card System Inc said on Monday that for the fiscal year ended December 31, it has experienced a loss of $.01 per share, versus a loss of $0.09 per share in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to provide further data.</p>
<p>Default said it was confident its business plan would generate valuable accomplishments and a prosperous 1997.</p>
</text>
